/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8004cd20_FUN_8004cd20.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `player`: player object. `+0x111C` is an `int` state; `+0x38D` the
///   owning-player index; `+0xAC` the position.
