/// When `+0x10D4` has neither bit `0x10000000` nor `0x08000000`, the function
/// queries event flag `0x30` and calls `0x8004BAC0(player, flag)`. Otherwise it
/// copies the model's `+0x1C` word into the actor's `+0x11C`.
