// predicates already translated above; the 0x8004C.../D... functions turn the
// resulting state into landing, slip, sand and turn effects. The 0x80056...
// functions are the small leaves those paths share: an event-flag bit array at
// `+0x1014`, the model-variant getter at vtable `+0x3D4`, and three slip/skid
// predicates. Every callee outside this file is still called by absolute
// address.
