// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x8004D040 - turn effect and turn-sound table
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Plays the turn sound/effect for the current state and refreshes the turn
/// smoke when the actor is moving.
///
/// While `+0x10C` is non-zero the function lazily fills the 13-byte sound-id
