/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8004D040` at `0x8004D040` (456 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8004d040_FUN_8004d040.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `player`: gameplay player object.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
