/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8004a400_FUN_8004a400.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `player`: gameplay player object.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the event flag, `+0x114`, `+0x10C`, `+0xEC`, `+0x14A4`,
/// `+0x14A8`; performs one interface call and up to two class/owner calls.
///
/// # Safety
/// `player + 0xDE8 -> +0x04` must be a live interface object, and `+0x60`
/// must hold a vtable with a `+0x434` slot.
