// 0x8004E1A0 - reset the player's animation interface
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Resets the player's motion, starts the `0x8035425C` animation with argument
/// `1`, and then applies the `0x8035476C` interface through [`fn_8004e290`].
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8004E1A0` at `0x8004E1A0` (120 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8004e1a0_FUN_8004e1a0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
