/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export file for `0x80049A40`.
/// - Extent: `0x80049A40..0x80049AB0` (112 bytes, 27 words), ending at the
///   `blr` at `0x80049AAC`; the next body starts at `0x80049AB0`
///   ([`fn_80049ab0`]).
/// - Reach: no `b`/`bl` in the main image; `d_enemiesNP` calls it from
///   `0x80A9657C`. No data word names it.
/// - Observed: `stwu r1,-0x10(r1)`; `mflr r0`; `li r4,0x45`;
///   `stw r0,0x14(r1)`; `stw r31,0xC(r1)`; `mr r31,r3`; `bl 0x80056CF0`;
