// 0x8005D090 - value matches the +0x60 word (or the word is empty)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Returns `0` when `+0x60` holds neither `0xFFFF_FFFF` nor `value`, and `1`
/// otherwise.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8005D090` at `0x8005D090` (40 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8005d090_FUN_8005d090.c`
///
