// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x8005E9A0 - spawn a type-0xE actor and optionally bind a source
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Spawns a type `0xE` actor through `0x80064610` and, when a source object is
/// supplied, binds it with `0x8014EA30` and forwards one byte of the source
/// flags to the new actor's virtual slot `+0x270`.
