/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8005B840` at `0x8005B840` (84 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8005b840_FUN_8005b840.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: manager; `+0x1C` bounds the search.
/// - `id`: slot id to locate.
///
/// # Returns
/// The preceding slot id, or `-1` when `id` is absent or is the first entry.
///
/// # Side effects
/// None; the loop only reads.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this + 0x1C` and the `+0x20` array up to that count must be readable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the `index != 0` guard and the `index - 1` fetch are literal.
