// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x8005EA60 - power-on reset of the four-slot tables
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Puts every spawn-manager table back to its initial state and marks slot `0`
/// present.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8005EA60` at `0x8005EA60` (164 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8005ea60_FUN_8005ea60.c`
///
