/// Clears the "sound paused" latch and re-arms the sound object, if the latch
/// is set.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80060700` at `0x80060700` (24 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80060700_FUN_80060700.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// None.
