// |---|---|---|
// | `0x80062600` | [`fn_80062600`] | store the three-word setup block `+0x3DC..+0x3E4` |
// | `0x80062610` | [`fn_80062610`] | gate on virtual `+0xE0`, then bind model variant `params & 0xFF` |
// | `0x80062B60` | [`fn_80062b60`] | `(ptr, count)` release: teardown, then free when `count > 0` |
// | `0x80062BC0` | [`fn_80062bc0`] | second copy, same body plus a dead duplicate null test |
// | `0x80062D00` | [`fn_80062d00`] | probe five `+0x30` children on vtable `+0x0C`, then recurse |
// | `0x80062DE0` | [`fn_80062de0`] | compare the virtual name with a path after the last `:` |
// | `0x80062EA0` | [`fn_80062ea0`] | pointer-to-member forwarder, descriptor at `first + 0x18` |
// | `0x80062ED0` | [`fn_80062ed0`] | pointer-to-member forwarder, descriptor at `first + 0x24` |
// | `0x80062F00` | [`fn_80062f00`] | spawn/init: decode `+0x04`, build the model set, project and sound |
// | `0x800630B0` | [`fn_800630b0`] | load `g3d/obj_dokan.brres` and create one + 32 + one models |
//
// `functions.tsv` reports 16/140/88/92/224/136/48/48/368/336 bytes. Every size
// was re-checked against the prologue and the `blr` (`0x8006260C`,
// `0x80062698`, `0x80062BB4`, `0x80062C18`, `0x80062DDC`, `0x80062E64`,
