/// vtable pointer whose `+0x5C` slot is a one-argument destructor.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - both loop shapes (`call, test, body`), the `+0x0B` guard, the
/// `u16 != 0x19B` filter and the `vtable + 0x5C` indirection were verified in
/// `0x80066EC0..0x80066F6C`. Only the registry roles are inferred, from the
/// documented shape of [`FN_80162D50_E`].
