/// [`crate::game::stage::fn_800708c0`] and the `+0x348` direction byte as the "invert" argument.
/// The signed height is truncated to `i16`, converted to `f32` with the
/// CodeWarrior `2^52` magic, multiplied by `0.3f` (`0x8042B898`), and truncated
/// again to form the target. `0x8015F200` then eases the halfword at `+0x100`
