/// dispatch runs at once. Otherwise [`fn_80057ad0`] can abort the frame, and a
/// non-zero slot-`+0x448` answer combined with a zero countdown byte and a
/// non-zero [`fn_8004b380`] ("busy movement") answer runs the turn handler
/// [`fn_800488f0`] with `0` and returns.
