/// Switches the actor into `WaitJump` when it is neither damaged nor flagged.
///
/// The gate is two tests, both of which must be clear:
/// * [`fn_8004dd00`] - the three primary damage modes `1`, `2` and `3`;
/// * event flag `4`, through [`fn_80056cf0`].
