/// The exact counterpart of [`fn_80057c80`], which clears the same flag `0xAC`
/// and rotates the counter into the `+0x1088` scratch word. [`fn_80057cc0`]
/// reads that scratch word back. The pair brackets a wait: the flag is set for
/// the whole countdown and the accumulated frame count is published when it is
/// cleared.
