///   `li r4,172`; `stw r0`; `stw r31,0xC(r1)`; `mr r31,r3`;
///   `bl 0x80056C70`; load `+0x1084`, `addi r0,r3,1`, store back; restore and
///   `bclr` at `0x80057C78`)
