/// Reuses a row carrying `id`, else takes the first free one, then runs the
/// kind-`1` tail.
///
/// This is [`fn_80058c10`] plus the wrapper trio of [`fn_80058a00`]: identity
/// match at `+0x9C`, fallback first-free scan, attach through `0x8027B1C0`,
/// link, then `0x80272C40`/`0x80272A10`/`0x80272D40` when `0x80275770` reports
/// kind `1`.
