///   the `bclr` which is the byte before the already-translated
///   [`fn_80058ee0`].
/// - Table: slot 11, word `0x80308A74` (header `0x80308A40`).
/// - Evidence: `work/wave275/d_dis.txt`.
///
/// # Arguments
