// `0x803078A8`/`0x803078DC`, and its own actor vtable `0x80307580` (slots
// `0x80307588..0x8030781C`). Immediately after it the `obj_dokan` unit starts
// with `"g3d/obj_dokan.brres"` at `0x80307A38`.
