// `daLiftDownOnBase_c` table `0x80307068` keeps the whole slot 1..53 run and
// the same 18-word tail. That tail (slots 54..71, the `0x80042C70` block
// below) is the lift-state virtual set: each body tail-calls the `+0x394`
