//
// ## Shape and identity
//
// `0x80306F78`/`0x80306F7C` are zero and `0x80306F80..0x80307060` is a
// fifty-seven-word method array. The installed pointer is the header, so the
// class dispatches through `[[this+0x60] + 8 + 4*slot]`; slot 56 (the last
// populated slot) lives at header `+0xE8`. The data block immediately before
// the header is the model/name block of this class:
//
// ```text
// 0x80306E40..0x80306F4C  thirteen "lift_ice_ashiba_WxH" model names
// 0x80306F4C  "g3d/lift_ice_ashiba.brres"  ends 0x80306F68
// 0x80306F68  "lift_ice_ashiba"            ends 0x80306F78
// 0x80306F78  0x00000000 0x00000000        this header
// 0x80306F80  fifty-seven method words     ends 0x80307064
// 0x80307064  0x00000000 (pure slot 57)
// 0x80307068  0x00000000
// 0x8030706C  0x00000000
// 0x80307070  the next class block
// ```
//
// The class is the ice-lift family already represented in this module by
// [`fn_80042480`] and [`fn_80042650`], which builds the
// `g3d/lift_ice_ashiba.brres` model into `+0x3EC` and the render node into
// `+0x3F0`. Three constructors in `d_basesNP` install this header at
// `object + 0x60` and then overwrite it with a derived table:
//
// | constructor | object size | intermediate store | final table |
// |---|---|---|---|
// | `0x80691450` | `0x508` | `0x80691478..0x80691484` | `0x807EFCFC` |
// | `0x806917C0` | `0x538` | `0x806917EC..0x806917F8` | `0x807EFDF4` |
// | `0x80691BB0` | `0x508` | `0x80691BD8..0x80691BE4` | `0x807EFEEC` |
//
// Each store is `lis r4,0x8030` / `addi r4,r4,28536` (`0x6F78`) /
// `stw r4,96(r31)`. The three derived tables are contiguous in `d_basesNP`,
// extend the base array with one further slot (`+0xEC`), and are followed
// directly by the state-name block `daIceAshibaWater_c::StateID_*` at
// `0x807F008C..0x807F0174`. That fixes the class family as
// `daIceAshibaWater_c`; the `lift_ice_ashiba` model names at `0x80306E40` are
// its size variants and the thirteen-entry record table at `0x802EE878`
// selects the variant from the low nibble of the spawn parameter word.
//
// ## Install site (first constructor, `0x80691450`)
//
// | address | instruction | value |
