// | | |
// |---|---|
// | slots / distinct | 57 / 57 |
// | covered before this lane | 50 (9 `functions.tsv` rows, all ledgered: 8 `game::player`, 1 `game::actors::dokan`; the same 50 have `src` bodies, 41 of them body-only) |
// | uncovered | **7** (4 prologue-shaped + 3 leaves) |
